      "math_academy_id": "e-22713",
      "problem": "A customer opens a bank account with a balance of ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14189344/assets/b6d32477e84b569c63644d22eac5c4ac7628d3513fa649efe3b53af4dd46bd63.svg). The account allows overdrafts, and the customer withdraws ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14189344/assets/3fb4b29875dcbc25b7a9836d939831543811af3f8b7959c34bbe2ef7c5739187.svg) each day for ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14189344/assets/0cf2eee0cdec31b7acdc244a255aaee7d6d520cfeee67b64ac9cf215f5377477.svg) days. What is the account balance after ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14189344/assets/0cf2eee0cdec31b7acdc244a255aaee7d6d520cfeee67b64ac9cf215f5377477.svg) days?",
      "worked_solution": "The bank balance decreases by ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14189344/assets/3fb4b29875dcbc25b7a9836d939831543811af3f8b7959c34bbe2ef7c5739187.svg) each day.\n\nSince the change is a decrease and occurs for ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14189344/assets/0cf2eee0cdec31b7acdc244a255aaee7d6d520cfeee67b64ac9cf215f5377477.svg) days, the total change can be written as repeated subtraction of ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14189344/assets/3474a36d6b0c9f191464fa9f990df13762af9a0c6b5e8138242a195cc33120e6.svg)\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14189344/assets/f5fbbe1aa003f39beaa1c8bbc83d1ba09f5588bb3e2a061287093e214f2ffb78.svg)\n\nRepeated subtraction can also be written using multiplication:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14189344/assets/4db89374d470b00b0463b35e087efbb5ebfd8cbc0e0a408a9bfaf052cd9c5a32.svg)\n\nEvaluating the product, we get\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14189344/assets/0a1462b31c3a16cb37e282f254ad252b061aff0534e9bdf5972144d7de7e5a8a.svg)\n\nTherefore, the account balance after ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14189344/assets/0cf2eee0cdec31b7acdc244a255aaee7d6d520cfeee67b64ac9cf215f5377477.svg) days is ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14189344/assets/27f2d0115060366cb914179f4e2e6e9b0f9ddb29a6530984a105d7a0f5f29f71.svg)",
